-- The inner loop.
--
-- `../agent-cat/haskell` is the sibling WORKING TREE, so an edit to
-- `Agentic.Cli` is visible to `cabal build` here without a commit, a push or a
-- flake bump. The flake does not read this file: it pins an agent-cat revision
-- and builds `agentic` from that (flake.nix, §3.2 of doc/design.md).
--
-- When the two disagree, the flake is authoritative — see README.md, "Which is
-- authoritative". `cabal build` green and `nix build` red almost always means
-- agent-cat has changes that are not pushed.
packages:
  .
  ../agent-cat/haskell
